v 3
d 'WILDCAT': Stata graph scheme and Northwestern University brand colors
d
d A modern, publication-grade Stata graph scheme synchronized with R ggplot2
d (theme_minimal) and Northwestern University's official brand color palette.
d
d KW: scheme
d KW: graphics
d KW: ggplot2
d KW: Northwestern
d
d Requires: Stata version 14.2
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261106
d
d Author: Aaron Wolf, Northwestern University
d Support: email aaron.wolf@u.northwestern.edu
d
